lekhani (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Official release version 1.0.0 by Syntenieum (2026).
  * Native pure Rust Bengali input method architecture.
  * Added dedicated ibus-lekhani and fcitx5-lekhani packages.
  * Added statistical N-gram Bengali language model & dynamic corpus trainer.
  * Special thanks to Avro Keyboard (OmicronLab) and OpenBangla Keyboard.

